  "cited_article_id": "configure-portal-result-visibility",
  "reply": "To set or adjust delayed release timers, go to **Settings > Patient Portal > Result Rules**. Click **Add Rule**, choose the lab category (e.g., Pathology or Imaging), enter the desired delay in hours in the **Hold Period** field, toggle **Auto-Release** on, and then click **Save**. The maximum hold period is 168 hours, and critical‑flagged results bypass the timer."
}
